1
00:00:00,475 --> 00:00:02,705
(Stuart:)the longer I'm alone,
the more desperate I get.

2
00:00:02,711 --> 00:00:08,151
(Amy:)Stuart, believe it or not,
I understand.

3
00:00:08,149 --> 00:00:09,679
(Amy:)You know, before I met Sheldon,

4
00:00:09,684 --> 00:00:12,314
(Amy:)I was alone
for a really long time.

5
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:14,220
(Amy:)I was so desperate

6
00:00:14,222 --> 00:00:16,592
(Amy:)for people to like me,
when I met these guys,

7
00:00:16,591 --> 00:00:19,861
(Amy:)it took everything in my power
to hide my insecurity.

8
00:00:22,863 --> 00:00:24,993
(laughing):
Okay, we're all feeling it.

9
00:00:24,999 --> 00:00:27,229
(Stuart:)Yes, I'll go out with you.

10
00:00:30,504 --> 00:00:33,774
(Amy:)Suddenly, the rabbit thing
makes sense.

11
00:00:36,410 --> 00:00:39,310
(Leonard:)I'm surprised you wanted to go
to a sports bar, Sheldon.

12
00:00:39,313 --> 00:00:41,783
(Sheldon:)Look at this blister.

13
00:00:41,783 --> 00:00:44,283
(Sheldon:)Like it or not,
we're athletes now.

14
00:00:44,285 --> 00:00:47,525
(Sheldon:)Besides, a bar is
where I belong.

15
00:00:47,522 --> 00:00:49,722
(Sheldon:)I'm having female problems.

16
00:00:49,724 --> 00:00:52,524
(Leonard:)If you're cranky and retaining
water, I have a theory.

17
00:00:53,860 --> 00:00:56,730
(Howard:)Sheldon, instead of focusing
on Amy dating other guys,

18
00:00:56,731 --> 00:00:59,261
(Howard:)maybe you should start thinking
about dating another girl.

